# Required build-time environment variables: none.
#
# Users enter provider API keys in the in-app settings panel. Do not put real
# Anthropic, OpenAI, or custom endpoint keys in this file.
#
# Optional production backend configuration:
# RENEX_PORT=3000
# RENEX_ALLOWED_ORIGIN=https://renex.example.com
# RENEX_PROVIDER_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
# RENEX_MAX_BODY_BYTES=65536
